#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place must give the person a copy of the Form 1` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place must give the person a copy of the Form 1` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place must give the person a copy of the Form 1` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- released on 20 June 2019: the copy may not be given before 10 June 2019 (10 days before).
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` (Date 20 6 2019) (Date 10 6 2019) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- exactly 10 days before
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` (Date 20 6 2019) (Date 9 6 2019) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- 11 days before: too early
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` (Date 20 6 2019) (Date 20 6 2019) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- on the day
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` (Date 5 7 2019) (Date 25 6 2019) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- across a month end: 25 June plus 10 days is 5 July
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` (Date 4 7 2019) (Date 24 6 2019) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(1) the copy was given not earlier than 10 days before the release or discharge` (Date 5 7 2019) (Date 24 6 2019) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no time limit is stated beyond the ten-day floor; the person in charge gives the copy: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 490.02915(1) the duty of the person in charge of the place to give a copy of the Form 1` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 490.02915(1) the person in charge of the place` DOES `s 490.02915(1) give the person a copy of the Form 1 referred to in subsection 490.02912(3)` AT 1

#ASSERT `s 490.02915(2) the Review Board must cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a) discharged absolutely
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(2) the Review Board must cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b) conditions that do not prevent compliance
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(2) the Review Board must cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (b) "unless" the conditions prevent compliance
#ASSERT `s 490.02915(2) the Review Board must cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the Board directs neither
#TRACE `s 490.02915(2) the duty of the Review Board to cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a Review Board` DOES `s 490.02915(2) cause a copy of the Form 1 to be given to the person` AT 1
